# Routes the @lakaut scope to Lakaut's private Nexus registry. Every other
# dependency keeps resolving from the default registry.
#
# Copy this file to .npmrc — which is gitignored — and provide LAKAUT_NPM_AUTH
# from the environment. The value is the Nexus credential from the integrator
# dashboard, shown exactly once. Never write it resolved into either file: the
# vendor treats a credential that reached a repository as compromised and
# rotation has no grace period.
#
# The Nexus credential is read-only and is for development and CI. It is not a
# runtime credential and cannot call the API.
#
# [Documented: docs/vendor/lakaut/sdk-integracion__credenciales.md
#  §"Acceso Nexus", §"Instalar los paquetes"]

@lakaut:registry=https://packages-preprod.lakautac.com.ar/repository/lakaut-sdk/
//packages-preprod.lakautac.com.ar/repository/lakaut-sdk/:_auth=${LAKAUT_NPM_AUTH}
always-auth=true
